  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>-digit numbers less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mo>,</mo></math> that are formed without using the digit <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and they all are multiple of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;is ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "7744",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>209</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>220</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>231</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>495</mn></math> series in A.P.</p><p>Clearly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>209</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>220</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>209</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>495</mn></math></p><p>Where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is the first term,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;is the common difference and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math>&nbsp;is the last term.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>495</mn></math></p><p>where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is the number of terms</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>209</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>495</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>286</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></math></p><p>Sum<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>209</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mn>26</mn></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>209</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>143</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>352</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9504</mn></math></p><p>Numbers containing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;at unit place <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>231</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>341</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>451</mn></math></p><p>Numbers containing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mtext>th</mtext></msup></math>&nbsp;place <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>319</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>418</mn></math></p><p>Hence, required sum of all&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>-digit&nbsp;numbers less than or equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9501</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>231</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>341</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>451</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>319</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>418</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7744</mn></math></p>",
